<meta name="citation_reference" content="Ryll R, Bernstein S, Heuser E, Schlegel M, Dremsek P, Zumpe M, Wolf S, Pépin M, Bajomi D, Müller G, Heiberg AC, Spahr C, Lang J, Groschup MH, Ansorge H, Freise J, Guenther S, Baert K, Ruiz-Fons F, Pikula J, Knap N, Tsakmakidis Ι, Dovas C, Zanet S, Imholt C, Heckel G, Johne R, Ulrich RG. Detection of rat hepatitis E virus in wild Norway rats (Rattus norvegicus) and Black rats (Rattus rattus) from 11 European countries. Vet Microbiol 2017;208:58–68. 10.1016/j.vetmic.2017.07.001." />
